Candidate cand-medium is on main of world/tuner (worker/config.json, commit 51b70d4d2de9cb59bdd79b66a0d80862d8b292c9). Only change from incumbent (claude-code, claude-sonnet-5-5, low): worker.roles.paper-repo.claude_code.env.CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL = "medium". Full content:
{"worker": {"roles": {"paper-repo": {"agent": "claude-code", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "claude_code": {"env": {"CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL": "medium"}}}}}}
Note: a continue with it works only if local-compute is not named in resources (see sparring-partner#3).
